## 🔧 What Was Fixed

**Root Cause:** Grafana directory structure issue during tar extraction

```bash
# Problem: When /opt/grafana already existed, mv would nest the directory
mv grafana-10.2.0 /opt/grafana
# Created: /opt/grafana/grafana-10.2.0/bin/grafana-server ❌

# Solution: Clean slate before extraction
rm -rf /opt/grafana
mv grafana-10.2.0 /opt/grafana
# Creates: /opt/grafana/bin/grafana-server ✅
```

**Files Modified:**
- `scripts/monitoring-setup.sh` - Added `rm -rf /opt/grafana` before move

